{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/borderfing.gif?t=1752800217\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sunset Inferno is a narrative-driven adventure RPG where your choices shape your fate and the lives of those around you.\u00a0Discover your true nature and forge your  destiny.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bomb goes off on the highway. A truck flips. You fall out: a tool built for a purpose you can barely remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who built you? Who broke you?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/bordercrop_ct.gif?t=1752800217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now you walk the streets of an unfamiliar city, something stirring inside you: <i>doubt</i>. And far below, beneath layers of concrete and iron, something ancient is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What are you?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pick your skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from three core skills. Each one shapes how you see the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/acc0fa7906c13ab37c813b49eb4abfb6.poster.avif?t=1752800217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/acc0fa7906c13ab37c813b49eb4abfb6.webm?t=1752800217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/acc0fa7906c13ab37c813b49eb4abfb6.mp4?t=1752800217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become The Recycler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn what you were built for, and why someone tried to destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/borderrunveg.gif?t=1752800217\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use the Listening Device</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tap into hidden thoughts and memories. Track signals to your next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/7e436d90942707eb29f49187b85bfdb1.poster.avif?t=1752800217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/7e436d90942707eb29f49187b85bfdb1.webm?t=1752800217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/7e436d90942707eb29f49187b85bfdb1.mp4?t=1752800217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover more through Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Investigate side quests scattered across the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3082700?t=1752800217","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/118b514f006fe4ef97fdb7c024d74d6d6fb1d353/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752800217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/dde701c603dad407bd6d638930768b65126f04ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752800217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/dde701c603dad407bd6d638930768b65126f04ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=175